Sparkle templates
-----------------
assets/bg_48.png
assets/bg_96.png

These are captures of the visible Gemini sparkle on a black background.
They are used as the alpha template for reverse blending.

Source: py-gemini-watermark-remover (MIT License)
https://github.com/daniel-style/py-gemini-watermark-remover

That project is a Python port of GeminiWatermarkTool by AllenK
https://github.com/allenk/GeminiWatermarkTool

assets/bg_96_20260520.png

Fainter 96px sparkle used on the newer large-margin layout.

Source: GeminiWatermarkRemover (MIT License)
Copyright (c) 2025 PlayerYK
https://github.com/PlayerYK/GeminiWatermarkRemover

The removal formula itself is the inverse of ordinary alpha compositing.

