Downloadable models
-------------------
These are not bundled. The app downloads them when asked and stores them
in a models folder next to the program.

RealESRGAN_General_x4_v3
realesrgan-x4plus-anime

Real-ESRGAN weights (BSD 3-Clause License)
Copyright (c) 2021 xinntao
https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN

General's ncnn pair is the conversion published in the Upscayl custom-models
repository. Anime detail is extracted from the same 20220424 Windows release
as the bundled models.

